note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note seed/build/release.om: Pure seeded-Omega Build, Release, UXL & Automation Coordinator.
note Replaces Makefile/shell/Python delivery glue:
note   om-release check-locks [ROOT]        verify omc pin, *.lock 40-hex commits, and zero-disk-secrets
note   om-release check-paths [ROOT]        pure-Omega replacement for tools/uxl/windows_paths.py
note   om-release layers [SCRATCH]          compile and run all 8 SI pure-Omega layer units-gate.om suites
note   om-release uxl [SCRATCH]             pure-Omega UXL delivery verification (host, level1 65 files, SPIR-V, Xe)
note   om-release package OUTDIR VERSION    build & package pure-Omega toolchain + SHA256SUMS + manifests
note   om-release verify OUTDIR             fail-closed re-hash verification of RELEASE-MANIFEST.tsv & SHA256SUMS
note Zero shell, zero Python.
note Build: cat seed/build/common.om seed/build/release.om | seed/out/omc > build/om-release

text rl_usage "usage: om-release check-locks [ROOT] | check-paths [ROOT] | layers [SCRATCH] | uxl [SCRATCH] | package OUTDIR VERSION | verify OUTDIR\n"
